cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the datasets, please cite the paper below."
title: "IL_Measurement: A Measurement Model for Impermanent Loss in Uniswap v3"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a measurement model that reconstructs individual Uniswap v3
  liquidity positions from on-chain snapshots and decomposes their realised
  outcome into impermanent loss and collected fees, covering 30,058 closed
  position observations across nine pools.
